# Negative checks for private Job Posting drafts. Run selectively against local test data.
# Prepare the Owner-created and Recruiter-created jobs using job-drafts.http first.
# The Recruiter must NOT be assigned to ownerJobId. outsiderToken belongs to another Company.
# staleJobVersion / staleRevisionVersion must be versions from BEFORE a successful save.
# Re-read the Recruiter job after each rejected save to confirm its content did not change.
# Keep pasted tokens local; do not commit them.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ownerToken = REPLACE_WITH_OWNER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@recruiterToken = REPLACE_WITH_RECRUITER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@outsiderToken = REPLACE_WITH_OTHER_COMPANY_ACCESS_TOKEN
@ownerJobId = REPLACE_WITH_OWNER_CREATED_JOB_ID
@recruiterJobId = REPLACE_WITH_RECRUITER_CREATED_JOB_ID
@staleJobVersion = 0
@staleRevisionVersion = 0
@notificationId = REPLACE_WITH_RECRUITER_NOTIFICATION_ID

### Anonymous private list — 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs

### Unassigned Recruiter cannot inspect the Owner's job — 404 JOB_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs/{{ownerJobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Cross-Company identifier — same 404 response as the absent identifier below
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs/{{ownerJobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}

### Absent positive identifier — 404 JOB_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs/9223372036854775807
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}

### Private scope is checked before missing versions — 404 rather than version details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs/{{ownerJobId}}/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {}
}

### Authorized save without versions — 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs/{{recruiterJobId}}/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {}
}

### Stale save after a successful update — 409 CONCURRENT_MODIFICATION
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs/{{recruiterJobId}}/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedJobVersion": {{staleJobVersion}},
  "expectedRevisionVersion": {{staleRevisionVersion}},
  "content": {"title": "This stale edit must not overwrite the saved draft"}
}

### Unknown content field — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {"unexpectedField": "not supported"}
}

### Invalid enum — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {"employmentType": "CASUAL"}
}

### Headcount outside structural bounds — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {"headcount": 10001}
}

### Ambiguous deadline without offset — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {"deadline": "2030-12-31T17:00:00"}
}

### Compensation with excessive fractional precision — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {"compensation": {"minimum": 1.001}}
}

### Read the Recruiter job after failed saves — content and versions should be unchanged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs/{{recruiterJobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Unsafe pagination offset — 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs?page=2147483647&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Invalid status filter — 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/jobs?status=UNKNOWN
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Another recipient cannot mark the Recruiter's notification read — 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
